'''Anti-Traitless Cats''' are effective against the [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy units.

Most non-gacha cats that are ''specifically'' anti-Traitless are [[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cats]] or obtained from [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]], and even gacha units tend to be exclusive to collabs, seasonal events or [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]]. In general, they are far more scarce than cats that target other types of enemies.

==Trivia==
*There was no way to filter for anti-Traitless units until [[Version 11.2 Update|Version 11.2]].
**However, from [[Version 8.0 Update|Version 8.0]] to [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]], a "W" ("White") icon could be found in the game's files among the many other trait icons. It remains unused, being superseded by the "None" icon. [[File:White icon.png|thumb|Unused original Traitless icon]]
